   171	- The registered text says the opening list is "verbatim" [R24]. The ruling asks for the list "nearly
   172	  verbatim" [R25]. This page copies it exactly.
   173	- A chain change to a DNSSEC algorithm outside {8, 13} makes new receipts CANNOT VERIFY. The service does not ship
   174	  those receipts [R26].
